      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/1754589788c79686f2_w.webp",
      "description": "A giant broccoli known as the Divine Tree grows in the middle of the city and looks down upon Seasoning City. It`s time to fill out surveys about career paths at Salt Middle School and the students are filled with various feelings. While they all talk about their hopes and dreams, Mob can`t seem to think of anything himself."
    },
    {
      "episode": 2,
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "title": "Yokai Hunter Amakusa Haruaki Appears! The Threat of a Hundred Demons!!",
      "aired": "2022-10-13T00:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2022-10-13T00:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17545899e5d0a28104_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/17/17545899e5d0a28104_w.webp",
      "description": "Mob is very busy preparing for the cultural fair that`s coming up in two weeks. Meanwhile, Serizawa is trying to start over, and is thinking about going to night school."
    },
    {
      "episode": 3,
      "episodeNumber": 3,
      "title": "Getting Carried Away: 100%",
      "aired": "2022-10-20T00:00:00+09:00",
