      "description": "After Psycho Helmet`s appearance, tree roots start emerging all around the city. Sensing danger, Mob goes with Reigen and Ritsu to destroy the Divine Tree, but eventually, they are overwhelmed by the members of the Psycho Helmet Religion."
    },
    {
      "episode": 5,
      "episodeNumber": 5,
      "title": "Divine Tree 2: Peace",
